---
title: VD Platform — Fluxo de Confirmação de Pagamento (FinanceService)
---
sequenceDiagram
  actor Admin as Admin
  participant API as API Route<br/>/api/reservations/[id]/receive-payment
  participant FS as FinanceService<br/>confirmPayment()
  participant TX as Prisma $transaction
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  Admin->>API: POST { amount, paymentMethod, operationRef }
  API->>API: Verificar auth + role (ADMIN/FINANCEIRO)
  API->>API: Validar input
  API->>FS: confirmPayment(prisma, input)

  FS->>DB: findUnique(Reservation + Plan)
  DB-->>FS: Reservation { totalAmount, companyId, ... }

  FS->>TX: $transaction(async tx => ...)

  rect rgb(30, 41, 59)
    Note over TX,DB: Bloco Atómico — ou tudo ou nada

    TX->>DB: PASSO 1: findFirst(Invoice where reservationId)
    DB-->>TX: null (não existe)
    TX->>DB: PASSO 2: count(Invoice where FT-SALA-2026-)
    DB-->>TX: 5
    TX->>DB: PASSO 3: create(Invoice { FT-SALA-2026-000006 })
    DB-->>TX: Invoice criada

    TX->>DB: PASSO 4: create(InvoicePayment { amount: 60000 })
    DB-->>TX: InvoicePayment criada

    TX->>DB: PASSO 5: Calcular newAmountPaid, balance, paidPct
    TX->>DB: PASSO 6: update(Invoice { amountPaid, balance, status: PARCIAL })
    DB-->>TX: Invoice actualizada

    TX->>DB: PASSO 7: count(Payment where REC-2026-)
    TX->>DB: PASSO 8: create(Payment { REC-2026-000007, status: PENDENTE })
    TX->>DB: update(Reservation { paymentId })

    TX->>DB: PASSO 9: update(Reservation { paymentStatus, amountPaid })
    DB-->>TX: Reservation actualizada

    TX->>DB: PASSO 10: count(LiquidationNote where NL-2026-)
    TX->>DB: PASSO 11: create(LiquidationNote { NL-2026-000004 })
    DB-->>TX: NL criada

    TX->>DB: PASSO 12: create(FinancialHistory) [se company]
    TX->>DB: PASSO 13: create(Timeline)
    TX->>DB: PASSO 14: create(FinancialAudit) [IMUTÁVEL]
  end

  TX-->>FS: { invoiceNumber, noteNumber, balance, ... }
  FS-->>API: ConfirmPaymentResult

  API->>API: publish("reservation.paymentReceived", ...)
  Note over API: Event Bus → Email, WhatsApp, Notificação

  API-->>Admin: 200 OK { invoiceNumber: "FT-SALA-2026-000006", balance: 40000 }
